ring update no changes there  just a new color for the current iphone  and now with all that said let's get  into the most exciting and most  important part of this entire event and  this new invitation which is titled peak  performance the big point that you need  to realize is that the ipad air and the  iphone sc are not going to get any  changes to performance at all they're  going to be getting the older chips so  if apple says peak performance that  means they are unveiling something  brand new  yes that means they're gonna unveil a  brand new chip  and we have been seeing a lot of rumors  that we should be seeing some new macs  so first of all potentially two desktop  macs and one  macbook according to the eec filings so  we should be expecting that and in terms  of which products first of all we think  it'll for sure be an m1 pro m1 max mac  mini with a new design but then  potentially either a new imac or a new  m2 mac mini yes m2 chip the brand new  empty chip as well as potentially an m2  macbook pro because we've seen many many  leaks about a new macbook pro coming at  this event even though it doesn't make  any sense at all like when digitimes  said it was coming and we all laughed at  them because they have a bad track  record i think it is actually coming  because we just seen so many leaks mark  german digit times other sources and  especially the eec filing i think it's  coming for sure and that is why apple is  calling it peak performance yes the new  m2 chip is likely to be revealed and now  as i'm checking my twitter for some  extra leaks while filming this video i  just got a tweet from dan roy which  basically back on the 22nd of last month  he posted a leak for march 8 2022 an  apple event with an iphone se ipad air  and a macbook pro so really guys i think  we're going to be seeing a new macbook  pro and unfortunately mark german said  that it's going to have a 13 inch  display it's not going to be 14 inch  like the current uh 2 000 macbook pr